e\"></div>\n    <div class=\"guide-line static\"></div>\n    <div class=\"time-series\">Time Series</div>\n\n    <div class=\"memory-loop second\"></div>\n    <div class=\"memory-loop\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"dash-box green-box event-panel\">\n      <div class=\"event-title\">Event Stream Recurrent Network</div>\n      <div class=\"event-time\">At time step t+1</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flow event-flow\">\n      <div class=\"event-cube placeholder\" aria-label=\"Diagram: event packet\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mini-stack\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"network\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"feature-stack dark\"></div>\n      <div class=\"feature-stack\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"feature-stack\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"feature-stack\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"lstm\">LSTM</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mlp-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"network\"></div>\n        <div class=\"mlp-label\">MLP</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"af\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"plus\">+</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pool-label\">Pooling</div>\n\n    <div class=\"dash-box blue-box frame-panel\">\n      <div class=\"frame-title\">Frame-Guided&nbsp; Network</div>\n      <div class=\"frame-time\">At time step t+1</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flow frame-flow\">\n      <div class=\"frame-icon placeholder\" aria-label=\"Diagram: guiding image frame\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow long\"></div>\n      <div class=\"cnn\">CNN</div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"feature-stack\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"feature-stack dark\"></div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mlp-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"network\"></div>\n        <div class=\"mlp-label\">MLP</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow short\"></div>\n      <div class=\"af\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"event-output-line\"></div>\n    <div class=\"frame-output-line\"></div>\n    <div class=\"merge-top\"></div>\n    <div class=\"merge-bottom\"></div>\n    <div class=\"plus merge-dot\">+</div>\n    <div class=\"fusion-route\"></div>\n    <div class=\"output-arrow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"output-stack\"></div>\n    <div class=\"output-label\">F<sub>output</sub></div>\n\n    <div class=\"perception-bracket\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"dash-box blue-box perception\">\n      <div class=\"perception-title\">Perceiving</div>\n\n      <div class=\"dash-box yellow-box dynamic-panel\">\n        <div class=\"force-title\">Dynamic</div>\n        <div class=\"plot placeholder\" aria-label=\"Chart: dynamic force\">\n          <div class=\"axis-x\"></div>\n          <div class=\"axis-y\"></div>\n          <div class=\"f-label\">F</div>\n          <div class=\"wave\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 65 35\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M0,31 C5,27 7,4 12,2 C16,2 15,31 20,31 C24,30 24,11 29,10 C34,10 34,24 39,24 C44,24 45,18 50,18 C56,18 56,29 65,30\"\n                    fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#18305d\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dash-box purple-box static-panel\">\n        <div class=\"force-title\">Static</div>\n        <div class=\"plot placeholder\" aria-label=\"Chart: static force\">\n          <div class=\"axis-x\"></div>\n          <div class=\"axis-y\"></div>\n          <div class=\"f-label\">F</div>\n          <div class=\"wave\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 65 35\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <path d=\"M0,30 C5,26 7,11 13,10 C20,10 20,30 29,30 C37,30 39,25 46,26 C53,26 56,30 65,30\"\n                    fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#18305d\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"caption\">\n    Fig. 2.&nbsp; The architecture of the proposed FGER-Net is presented, alongside its conceptual underpinnings. The left portion illustrates the biological inspiration for the network: the synergistic function of fast and slow adapting mechanoreceptors in perceiving dynamic and static forces, respectively.<br>\n    These biological principles are emulated by the FGER-Net. In the network itself (center), event streams and image frames are synergistically fused for robust force estimation. In this architecture, frames are used to periodically correct for drift during training and to continuously stabilize the high frequency force predictions derived from the event stream during inference. The resulting force estimation is thereby made accurate and robust against drift, successfully capturing both dynamic and static tactile information, mirroring the perceptual capabilities shown on the right side of the diagram.\n  </div>\n\n  <main class=\"paper-body\">\n    <article class=\"article-column\">\n      <p>dual rate architecture mirrors biological perception: a high frequency recurrent pathway integrates transient force increments from the event stream, while a low frequency pathway extracts absolute spatial references from single image frames for periodic training corrections.</p>\n\n      <p>During inference, we maximize estimation stability via a continuous correction strategy. By persistently fusing the most recent frame feature with incoming events, this absolute spatial anchor effectively eliminates integration drift.</p>\n\n      <p>The architecture utilizes dual parallel pathways optimized for each modality’s distinct characteristics. To circumvent the extreme sparsity typical of standard convolutions on event data, individual events are normalized and processed by a pointwise MLP, followed by max-pooling to generate an aggregated feature vector for each packet. Conversely, dense spatial information from image frames is extracted into a compact feature vector using a residual CNN backbone coupled with average pooling.</p>\n\n      <p class=\"subsection\"><span class=\"lead\">a) Data Stream Segmentation:</span>&nbsp; The algorithm’s processing cycle is driven by the arrival of new frames. A cycle is</p>\n    </article>\n\n    <section class=\"algorithm\" aria-label=\"Algorithm 1 FGER-Net\">\n      <div class=\"algorithm-title\"><strong>Algorithm 1</strong>&nbsp; FGER-Net</div>\n      <div class=\"algorithm-content\">\n        <div class=\"alg-line\"><span class=\"alg-label\">Input:</span>&nbsp; $I_{\\mathrm{guide}},\\ \\{P_m\\}_{m=1}^{M},\\ f_{\\mathrm{prev\\_cycle}},\\ (h_{\\mathrm{prev\\_cycle}}, C_{\\mathrm{prev\\_cycle}})$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line\"><span class=\"alg-label\">Output:</span>&nbsp; $\\hat f_{\\mathrm{final}},\\ (h_M,C_M)$</div>\n\n        <div class=\"alg-line alg-heading\">Guiding Frame Feature Extraction</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line\">$\\mathbf{f}_{\\mathrm{frame}} \\leftarrow \\Phi_f(I_{\\mathrm{guide}})$</div>\n\n        <div class=\"alg-line alg-heading\">Recurrent Processing Loop</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line\">$\\hat f_0 \\leftarrow f_{\\mathrm{prev\\_cycle}};\\ (h_0,C_0) \\leftarrow (h_{\\mathrm{prev\\_cycle}},C_{\\mathrm{prev\\_cycle}})$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line forline\">for&nbsp; $m \\leftarrow 1$ to $M$ do</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line indent1\">$\\mathbf{f}_{e,m} \\leftarrow \\Phi_e(P_m)$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line indent1\">$\\mathbf{x}_m \\leftarrow \\operatorname{concatenate}(\\mathbf{f}_{e,m},\\hat f_{m-1})$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line indent1\">$(h_m,C_m) \\leftarrow \\operatorname{LSTM}(\\mathbf{x}_m,(h_{m-1},C_{m-1}))$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line indent1\">$\\Delta \\hat f_m \\leftarrow \\operatorname{MLP}_{\\Delta f}(h_m)$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line indent1\">$\\hat f_m \\leftarrow \\hat f_{m-1}+\\Delta \\hat f_m$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line endline\">end for</div>\n\n        <div class=\"alg-line alg-heading\">Fusion and Correction</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line\">$\\mathbf{f}_{\\mathrm{fusion}} \\leftarrow \\operatorname{concatenate}(\\hat f_M,\\mathbf{f}_{\\mathrm{frame}})$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line\">$\\Delta f_{\\mathrm{corr}} \\leftarrow \\operatorname{MLP}_{\\mathrm{corr}}(\\mathbf{f}_{\\mathrm{fusion}})$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line\">$\\hat f_{\\mathrm{final}} \\leftarrow \\hat f_M+\\Delta f_{\\mathrm{corr}}$</div>\n        <div class=\"alg-line returnline\">return&nbsp; $\\hat f_{\\mathrm{final}},(h_M,C_M)$</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
